                                                "sense_id": "2bc8f26d-2377-33a6-958a-38b210df852d",
                                                "text": "Now here Chriſtian was worſe put to it then in his fight with Apollyon, as by the ſequel you ſhall ſee."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41f05dbd-fb8f-4bee-a510-69f2a809d120",
                                                "sense_id": "2bc8f26d-2377-33a6-958a-38b210df852d",
                                                "text": "In its sixty-year history here, some 4,170 engines of the 4-6-0 type have been constructed. This is the vast sequel of that bold experimental step of the Highland Railway in 1894."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1db48f6d-8438-3097-8a87-faef7e6cfdc1",
