                                                "sense_id": "d59492d0-557d-3002-b9bf-b38899fad6ce",
                                                "text": "It greatly resembles the Rabbinical account of the origin of the Mazckeen, which the reader will meet in the sequel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "035492df-2017-3f14-b1de-18e5f7463be3",
                                        "entry_id": "8c52620a-11dc-3b8b-912b-3fc400a7318b",
                                        "glosses": [
